<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Unocal started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Unocal started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NatWest Securities said it started Unocal Corp with an accumulate rating.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1/2 to 38-1/8.</p>
